# Keep UI test expectation files stable across platforms.
*.stderr text eol=lf
*.stdout text eol=lf
*.fixed text eol=lf
# A `// run-rustfix` fixture is compared byte-for-byte with its `*.fixed`
# expectation, and rustfix copies the lines it does not replace verbatim.
# A CRLF checkout therefore turns a correct fix into a whole-file diff, so
# the fixture inputs are pinned to the same encoding as their expectations.
*.rs text eol=lf
